From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZhangDM-520 <jixianqiang1540@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:05:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build/pgo: drop the deprecated Speedometer 2.0 workload
 entry

The profile corpus already trains Speedometer 3 through the existing
http://localhost:8000 entry: profileserver.py starts sp3_httpd with the
Speedometer3 tree as its root-path docroot, the harness honours
?startAutomatically=true, and the entry carries extendedTimeout (120 s).
The Speedometer 2.0 entry only duplicated that coverage with the
deprecated single-scenario suite, so removing it is the whole of the
SP2 -> SP3 switch. Every other workload entry is untouched and
profileserver.py needs no change.
---
 build/pgo/index.html | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/build/pgo/index.html b/build/pgo/index.html
--- a/build/pgo/index.html
+++ b/build/pgo/index.html
@@ -121,7 +121,6 @@
 
   // Add items that needs longer timeouts
   items.push(
-    new Item("webkit/PerformanceTests/Speedometer/index.html", extendedTimeout),
     new Item(
       "http://localhost:8000/index.html?startAutomatically=true",
       extendedTimeout
-- 
2.51.0
